    "detailed_description": "Hello, this is a simple retro car drifting game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy-to-use drift operation for one-handed play.<br></li><li>4 retro cars, 3 mini track maps.<br></li><li>The number of AIs can be set, with a minimum of 0 and a maximum of 19, and a maximum of 20 cars can race at the same time.<br></li><li>Steam achievements support.<br></li><li>Steam leaderboard support.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Play</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make as many perfect drifts as possible and accumulate score.<br></li><li>Collect as many small wrenches as possible to increase your score.<br></li><li>Avoid obstacles on the road.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Hello, this is a simple retro car drifting game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy-to-use drift operation for one-handed play.<br></li><li>4 retro cars, 3 mini track maps.<br></li><li>The number of AIs can be set, with a minimum of 0 and a maximum of 19, and a maximum of 20 cars can race at the same time.<br></li><li>Steam achievements support.<br></li><li>Steam leaderboard support.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Play</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make as many perfect drifts as possible and accumulate score.<br></li><li>Collect as many small wrenches as possible to increase your score.<br></li><li>Avoid obstacles on the road.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Retro Drift&quot; is a small arcade drift game that can be played with one hand. The game advocates fast-paced play, a 10-second start, and a ten-minute game. The number of AI can be set, which is suitable for a game anytime, anywhere.",
